<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">- Sefwi New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">YUDA</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yud</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yuda</para>
  <para style="toc1">YUDA</para>
  <para style="mt1">YUDA</para>
  <para style="mt4">NWOMAA</para>
  <para style="ip">Yuda bɔ ɔhworɔle krataa he ne, né oliema yeɛ ole Yesu ne Yakobo. Ɛkora nwu ye kyɛ, bɛ bɔ ɔhworɔle krataa ne mane bɛ ne, né bɛte Yudafoɛ, na sɛ maen-maen nufoɛ wɔ nu po a, né bɛse Yudafoɛ amammerɛ ne bɛ nneyɛɛ. Kɔyɛ afoɛ 65 Y.A <note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Y.A kyire Yesu Aberɛ so (Brɔfo: </char><char style="it">Common Era</char> anaa <char style="it">C.E</char>)</note> yeɛ Yuda hworɔle ye krataa ne ɔ, na né ɔwɔ Israel. Edwirɛ bɔ Yuda hane ye nwo dwirɛ ne, ɔte kyɛ edwirɛ bɔ Petro hane ye nwo dwirɛ wɔ <char style="bk">2 Petro 2</char> nanu ne.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mmerɛ bɔ ɔhworɔle ye krataa ne, né aliemaa nemɔ bie yɛ bɛ nikye te kyɛ ngaka ne. Yeti ɔha hyirele Kristofoɛ ne kyɛ, bɛho paa bɛbɔ gyidie bɔ bafa bama akrongronfoɛ nanwo waen.―<char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:3">Yud 3</ref>.</char></para>
  <para style="ip">Edwirɛ bɔ osili tete ne, Yuda fale bie yɛle nneasoɛ. Ɔmaa bɛnwuni kyɛ, mmerɛ bɔ Nyameɛ yele Israelfoɛ nemɔ fili Egypt ne, yesi ne ɔsɛkyele bɛ bɔ ne belle gyidie ne. Afei koso, bɔ ɔtole Sodom ne Gomora ne nguro bɔ wapɛ bɛ nwo wayia ne, ɔhane kyɛ ɔte kɔkɔbɔ ma yɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bɛ bɔ ne bawiewia bɛ nwo baawura Kristofoɛ asafo nanu ne, ɔhane bɛ nwo dwirɛ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Bɛte kyɛ nyɔboɛ bɔ owura nzue bo ne;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Munungum bɔ nzue nne nu bɔ mvrama fa ye kyini;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Mmakaa bɔ mmerɛ aso kyɛ osu mmaa, nakoso hwee nne so;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Ɛpo asorɔkye bɔ obu fa so pu ye bɔbɔ ye animguaseɛ ba;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Ɔne nzramaa bɔ bɛkyini mbaen bɔ basiesie awosii bama bɛ.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ip">Edwirɛ biemɔ wɔ Yuda nwomaa nanu bɔ ɔnne Bible ne nekafee kõ. Ebie yeɛ ole:</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Edwirɛ bɔ ɔhɔle so wɔ Abɔfo panyi Mikael ne Abɔnzam afia wɔ Mose fuin nwo ne.―<char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:9">Yud 9</ref>.</char></para>
  <para style="ipi">• Enok ngɔmhyɛ bɔ ɔfa abɔfo pee bɔ Nyameɛ nate bɛ so kobu abɔnefoɛ atɛn ne.―<char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:14">Yud 14</ref>, <ref loc="JUD 1:15">15</ref>.</char></para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ip">Ɔbaayie ye krataa ne, ɔhyɛle oliema nemɔ nguraen kyɛ, bɛfa bɛ nwo bɛwura Nyameɛ dɔ nu, (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:21">Yud 21</ref></char>); bɛ bɔ b'adwene nu yɛ bɛ naa ne, bɛhɔ so bɛnwu b'anwunvo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:22">Yud 22</ref></char>); na bɛle bɛ ngoa, mmerɛ bɔ bɛtwe bɛ bɛfi see nu ne.―<char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:23">Yud 23</ref></char></para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">ENU DWIRƐ</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngyeaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Akyerɛkyerɛfoɛ bɔ bɛnga nahorɛ né atemmuo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:3-16">1:3-16</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mikael ne Abɔnzam yeye edwirɛ noa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:9">1:9</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Enok ngɔmhyɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:14-15">1:14-15</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛmɔfa ɛmɔ nwo bɛwura Nyameɛ dɔ nu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:17-23">1:17-23</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Anuonyam ha Nyameɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:24-25">1:24-25</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Yuda, Yesu Kristo akoaa ne Yakobo aliema;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JUD 1:1">Mefa krataa he mekɔma bɛ bɔ bafrɛ bɛ, bɔ bɛla Nyameɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Baba Nyameɛ” </char></note> ahone so ná Yesu Kristo afa bɛ asie ne.<verse eid="JUD 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Me mbaeɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ Nyameɛ nwu ɛmɔ anwunvo, na ɔma asomdwie ne ɔdɔ bu ɛmɔ so.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Aliemaa mɔ, ahaa metworɔ ngoa bɔ yɛ mukoraati yekonya ye nanwo dwirɛ mebrɛ ɛmɔ, nakoso nwuni kyɛ odikyɛ metworɔ mebatu ɛmɔ fo kyɛ, ɛmɔho paa bɛbɔ gyidie bɔ bafa bama akrongronfoɛ nanwo waen. Bafa sɔ gyidie ne bama yɛ pɛnko kyɛ ɔtena berɛ daa. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, mmenia biemɔ awiewia bɛ nwo baawura ɛmɔ nu. Ofi teteete yeɛ tworɔnzɛm ne hane kyɛ sɔ mmenia nemɔ konya atemmuo, bɛte amumuyɛfoɛ, na bafa yɛ Nyameɛ adom ne bakata bɛ nyunu bɛfa bɛbɔ ahohwibra. Na Yesu Kristo bɔ ɔte yɛ wura ne y'Awurade komapɛ ne po, benne ye bɛndonu.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Ɔwɔ nu, ɛmɔse ɛhe dada, nakoso mepena kyɛ mekaye ɛmɔ kyɛ, mmerɛ bɔ Nyameɛ yele mmenia biemɔ fili Egypt ne si ne, ɔsɛkyele bɛ bɔ né belle gyidie ne. <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Na abɔfo bɔ bandena nekaa bɔ bɛte, ná bɛyakyile dibea bɔ bɛle ye ne berɛ ne, wafa kyenyi wakyekye bɛ afebɔɔ wagua awosii nu, na bɛnwondɛ kyẽa kandinga bɔ okobu atɛn ne. <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />Sɔ ala yeɛ Sodom ne Gomora ne nguro bɔ wapɛ ye nwo wayia ne koso fale bɛ nwo wurale adwamammɔ bɔ ɔyɛ tɛ, ne nnaa nwo akɔnnɔ bɔ ɔte mmusue nu, na ɔfale see bɔ ɔsɔ daa hwene bɛ so fa yɛle nneasoɛ mane yɛ.<verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Ye mukoraati nu ne, sɔ mmenia hemɔ bɔ bɛnwa bɛkye nnaleɛ ne gua anwoɔnaen nanwo fiɛ, bɛmmu bɛ bɔ bɛle tumi ne, na bɛdwudwo betia bɛ bɔ bɛle anuonyam ne. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />Nakoso, mmerɛ bɔ abɔfo panyi Mikael po ne Abɔnzam nyane dwudwolɛ wɔ Mose fuin nwo ne, wamva ye pɛ wanga edwirɛ biala wandia ye kyɛ ɔfa bu ye atɛn, mmom bɔ ɔhane yeɛ ole kyɛ, “Awurade hwi wɔ nyunu.” <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Nakoso, sɔ mmenia hemɔ de, nikye biala bɔ bɛnde yebo ne, bɛdwudwo betia, na bɔ bɛte yebo ne koso, bɛyɛ ye te kyɛ ngaka bɔ belle adwene ne; bɛyɛ bɛfa bɛsɛkye bɛ nwo. <verse eid="JUD 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Bɛ yaakɔ, ofikyɛ bɔ Kain yɛle ne bie yeɛ bɛyɛ ne, na adufum ti, baafa Balaam atee tɛɛ naso, bɛsuesua Kora atuateɛ ne, yeti kyɛbɔ bɛsɛkyele ye ne, sɔ ala yeɛ bɛkɔsɛkye bɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JUD 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Sɛ ɛmɔyia nu kyɛ ɛmɔdidi a, ɛyɛ a ne sɔ mmenia hemɔ ayɛ kyɛ nyɔboɛ bɔ wafea nzue bo ne, bɛte mmoan-neafoɛ bɔ bɛ ko ngome yeɛ ohia bɛ, bɛnzuro hwee. Bɛte munungum bɔ nzue nne nu, bɔ mvrama fa ye kyini, mmakaa bɔ mmerɛ aso kyɛ osu mmaa, nakoso hwee nne so, wawuwu koraa,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “bawuwu pɛn nyɔ”</char></note> na ye bo atutu. <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />Bɛte ɛpo asorɔkye bɔ obu fa so pu ye bɔbɔ ye animguaseɛ ba, na bayɛ kyɛ nzramaa bɔ bɛkyini mbaen bɔ basiesie awosii bama bɛ ne.<verse eid="JUD 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Enok bɔ ɔtɔ Adam aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ so nzoo ne hyɛle sɔ mmenia hemɔ nwo ngɔm kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JUD 1:14">“Nea, Awurade fale ye anwoteefoɛ pee wale,<verse eid="JUD 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />na obuli ebiala atɛn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JUD 1:15">obuli amumuyɛfoɛ atɛn wɔ nningyein tɛɛ bɔ bɛyɛle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JUD 1:15">ɔne edwirɛ bɔ ɛte a, ne wɔ kunu ate wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JUD 1:15">bɔ abɔnefoɛ bɔ bɛnzuro Nyameɛ ne keka hyirele ye nanwo.”<verse eid="JUD 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Sɔ mmenia hemɔ nwii-nwii, na bɔ bɛle ye biala ne, bɛ nye nzɔ. Bɛdi bɛ bɔbɔ b'akɔnnɔ si, bɛdwa bɛ noa nu, na mvasoɛ bɔ bɛpena nati bɛhoɔhoa mmenia.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Aliemaa mɔ, ɛmɔkaye bɔ Awurade Yesu Kristo asomafoɛ ne hane ne, <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />bɛhane kyɛ: “Awieɛ mmerɛ nanu ne, bɛ bɔ bɛka ayinga na bɛdi b'akɔnnɔ si kɔwa.” <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Sɔ mmenia hemɔ pakye-pakye asafo nanu, bɛdi anwoɔnaen akɔnnɔ si, na bɛmma Nyameɛ honhom ngyire bɛ atee. <verse eid="JUD 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Nakoso adɔfo, ɛmɔ de ɛmɔyɛ se wɔ ɛmɔ gyidie krongron nanu, na ɛmɔbɔ mbaeɛ wɔ honhom krongron nu <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔnwondɛ y'Awurade Yesu Kristo anwunvoin bɔ ɔkɔ daa ngoa nu ne, ɛmɔfa ɛmɔ nwo bɛwura Nyameɛ dɔ nu.<verse eid="JUD 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Ɛmɔnwu bɛ bɔ b'adwene nu yɛ bɛ naa n'anwunvo, <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />ɛmɔle bɛ ngoa mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔtwe bɛ bɛfi see nu ne. Ɛmɔhɔ so bɛnwu afoforɛ anwunvo, nakoso ɛmɔnea yé, ofikyɛ bafa anwoɔnaen akɔnnɔ basɛkye ndadeɛ bɔ owura bɛ nanu. Yeti ɛmɔhwe ɛmɔ nwo bɛfi ndadeɛ bɔ owura bɛ nanwo.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Afei, Nyameɛ bɔ ɔbɔ ɛmɔ nwo waen, na hwee ando ɛmɔ sintidua, na ɔmaa ɛmɔfa anigye begyina ye anuonyam ne nyunu bɔ ngekayɛɛ biala nne ɛmɔ nwo ne, <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />y'Agyenkwa Nyameɛ komapɛ ne, ye yeɛ anuonyam, anwoserɛ ne tumi ha ye fi tete, ɛnɛ, ɔne daa wɔ y'Awurade Yesu Kristo nu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JUD 1:25">Amen.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>